    "detailed_description": "- Overview.<br />\r\nMemory Of Psycho is a game in which players relive the memories of a young man.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player acts as the protagonist, a young man who has lost his memory.<br />\r\nTouching certain objects in the room where he woke up triggers flashbacks of his past memories.<br />\r\nBy using hints and other information to act in the flashbacks at a predetermined time, the player can uncover what happened in the past one after another.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Memory Recall.<br />\r\nIn a flashback of a past memory, an event called \u201cmemory recall\u201d occurs.<br />\r\nThere is a time limit while the memory is being replayed, and if you do not take any action, you will leave the flashback.<br />\r\nLook for clues that exist in the room or in items, etc., and try to recall your memories until the end.",
    "about_the_game": "- Overview.<br />\r\nMemory Of Psycho is a game in which players relive the memories of a young man.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player acts as the protagonist, a young man who has lost his memory.<br />\r\nTouching certain objects in the room where he woke up triggers flashbacks of his past memories.<br />\r\nBy using hints and other information to act in the flashbacks at a predetermined time, the player can uncover what happened in the past one after another.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Memory Recall.<br />\r\nIn a flashback of a past memory, an event called \u201cmemory recall\u201d occurs.<br />\r\nThere is a time limit while the memory is being replayed, and if you do not take any action, you will leave the flashback.<br />\r\nLook for clues that exist in the room or in items, etc., and try to recall your memories until the end.",
    "short_description": "A game to relive the memories of a young man.",
